! sense.guest.reads ~ the live topology, and who spawned each

`lares mempalace status` prints every guest daemon, holder, mine and hook leg beside its spawner, read off the live process table (no pidfile), so the output teaches killing the spawner, never the children.

<<~/ahu>>

